---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Cookie Policy | UK Rivers Directory"
  description="Cookie Policy for UK Rivers Directory. Learn about the cookies we use and how to manage them."
>
  <div class="legal-page">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>
      <p class="last-updated">Last Updated: December 2025</p>

      <section>
        <h2>Introduction</h2>
        <p>
          This Cookie Policy explains how UK Rivers Directory uses cookies and similar technologies on our website. By using our website, you consent to the use of cookies as described in this policy.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>What Are Cookies?</h2>
        <p>
          Cookies are small text files that are placed on your device (computer, smartphone, or tablet) when you visit a website. Cookies help websites remember your preferences and understand how you use the site, making your browsing experience more efficient and personalized.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Types of Cookies We Use</h2>

        <h3>Essential Cookies</h3>
        <p>
          These cookies are necessary for the website to function properly. They enable core functionality such as security, network management, and accessibility. You cannot opt out of these cookies.
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Cookie Consent:</strong> Remembers your cookie preferences</li>
          <li><strong>Session Management:</strong> Maintains your session as you navigate the site</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>Performance Cookies</h3>
        <p>
          These cookies collect information about how you use our website, such as which pages you visit most often. This data helps us improve how our website works.
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Analytics:</strong> Tracks page views and user interactions</li>
          <li><strong>Error Tracking:</strong> Helps us identify and fix technical issues</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>Functional Cookies</h3>
        <p>
          These cookies allow our website to remember choices you make and provide enhanced, more personalized features.
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Preferences:</strong> Remembers your settings and preferences</li>
          <li><strong>Search History:</strong> Helps improve search functionality</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>How We Use Cookies</h2>
        <p>We use cookies to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Remember your preferences and settings</li>
          <li>Understand how you use our website</li>
          <li>Improve website performance and user experience</li>
          <li>Analyze website traffic and usage patterns</li>
          <li>Remember your cookie consent preferences</li>
          <li>Provide personalized content and features</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Third-Party Cookies</h2>
        <p>
          Some cookies on our website are placed by third-party services. These may include:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Analytics Services:</strong> Help us understand website usage</li>
          <li><strong>Content Delivery Networks:</strong> Ensure fast page loading</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          We do not control how third parties use cookies. Please review the privacy policies of these third parties for more information.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Cookie Duration</h2>
        <p>Cookies may be stored for different durations:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Session Cookies:</strong> Temporary cookies deleted when you close your browser</li>
          <li><strong>Persistent Cookies:</strong> Remain on your device for a set period or until manually deleted</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Managing Cookies</h2>
        <p>You have several options for managing cookies:</p>

        <h3>Browser Settings</h3>
        <p>
          Most browsers allow you to control cookies through their settings. You can:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>View cookies stored on your device</li>
          <li>Delete cookies</li>
          <li>Block all cookies</li>
          <li>Allow cookies from specific websites only</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Please note that blocking cookies may affect your ability to use certain features of our website.</p>

        <h3>Browser-Specific Instructions</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Chrome:</strong> Settings → Privacy and Security → Cookies</li>
          <li><strong>Firefox:</strong> Options → Privacy & Security → Cookies and Site Data</li>
          <li><strong>Safari:</strong> Preferences → Privacy → Cookies and Website Data</li>
          <li><strong>Edge:</strong> Settings → Privacy & Security → Cookies</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>Opt-Out Tools</h3>
        <p>
          You can also use online tools to manage advertising cookies and tracking:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="https://www.youronlinechoices.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Your Online Choices</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://optout.networkadvertising.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Network Advertising Initiative</a></li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Your Consent</h2>
        <p>
          When you first visit our website, you'll see a cookie banner asking for your consent. You can:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Accept all cookies</li>
          <li>Manage your preferences</li>
          <li>Continue browsing (which implies acceptance of essential cookies)</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          You can change your cookie preferences at any time by clearing your browser cookies and revisiting our website, or by using your browser settings.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Updates to This Policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this Cookie Policy from time to time to reflect changes in our practices or for legal reasons. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated revision date.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>More Information</h2>
        <p>For more information about cookies and how to manage them, visit:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="https://www.aboutcookies.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">AboutCookies.org</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://www.allaboutcookies.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">AllAboutCookies.org</a></li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Contact Us</h2>
        <p>If you have any questions about our use of cookies, please contact us:</p>
        <p>
          Email: info@ukrivers.directory<br>
          Contact Form: <a href="/contact">Contact Page</a>
        </p>
        <p>
          For information about how we handle your personal data, please see our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    padding: calc(var(--spacing-unit) * 10) 0;
    min-height: 100vh;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 calc(var(--spacing-unit) * 3);
  }

  .legal-page h1 {
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: calc(var(--spacing-unit) * 2);
  }

  .last-updated {
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    font-style: italic;
    margin-bottom: calc(var(--spacing-unit) * 4);
  }

  .legal-page section {
    margin-bottom: calc(var(--spacing-unit) * 5);
  }

  .legal-page h2 {
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-top: calc(var(--spacing-unit) * 4);
    margin-bottom: calc(var(--spacing-unit) * 2);
    padding-bottom: calc(var(--spacing-unit) * 1);
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .legal-page h3 {
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-top: calc(var(--spacing-unit) * 3);
    margin-bottom: calc(var(--spacing-unit) * 1.5);
  }

  .legal-page p {
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .legal-page ul {
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: calc(var(--spacing-unit) * 2);
    padding-left: calc(var(--spacing-unit) * 4);
  }

  .legal-page li {
    margin-bottom: calc(var(--spacing-unit) * 1);
  }

  .legal-page a {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .legal-page a:hover {
    color: var(--color-primary-dark);
  }
</style>
